//! Cross-process minimal-metadata pairwise KeyPackage coverage.
//!
//! This scenario uses a pre-built Soland process and real RFC 9420
//! KeyPackages generated by `ArkretMlsIdentity`. The authenticated human
//! session is transport authority only: neither pairwise actor has an account,
//! device authorization, or session whose actor equals the pairwise DID.

